#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: atesto.php
msgid "Atesto - Social Proof for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Atesto - Social Proof für WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: atesto.php
msgid "https://plogins.com/plogins-proof/"
msgstr "https://plogins.com/plogins-proof/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: atesto.php
msgid "Show recent-sale social-proof popups to build trust and urgency."
msgstr ""
"Zeige Social-Proof-Popups aus aktuellen Verkäufen an, um Vertrauen und "
"Dringlichkeit aufzubauen."

#. Author of the plugin
#: atesto.php
msgid "WPPoland.com"
msgstr "WPPoland.com"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: atesto.php
msgid "https://wppoland.com"
msgstr "https://wppoland.com"

#: atesto.php:48
msgid "Atesto requires WooCommerce to be active."
msgstr "Atesto erfordert ein aktives WooCommerce."

#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:85
msgid "Coming soon"
msgstr "Demnächst"

#. translators: 1: currency symbol, 2: yearly price
#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:91
#, php-format
msgid "from %1$s%2$d/yr"
msgstr "ab %1$s%2$d/Jahr"

#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:100
msgid "Upgrade to PRO"
msgstr "Auf PRO upgraden"

#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:101
msgid "Get notified"
msgstr "Benachrichtige mich"

#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:131
msgid "Permission denied."
msgstr "Zugriff verweigert."

#. translators: %s: PRO edition name
#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:161
#, php-format
msgid "Do more with %s"
msgstr "Mehr erreichen mit %s"

#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:168
msgid "Dismiss this notice"
msgstr "Diesen Hinweis ausblenden"

#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:190
msgid "Unlock every PRO feature"
msgstr "Alle PRO-Funktionen freischalten"

#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:203
msgid "one licence, every PRO feature"
msgstr "eine Lizenz, alle PRO-Funktionen"

#. translators: %s: PRO edition name
#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:222
#, php-format
msgid "What %s adds"
msgstr "Was %s ergänzt"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:52 src/Admin/Settings.php:119
msgid "Atesto: Sales Notifications"
msgstr "Atesto: Verkaufsbenachrichtigungen"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:53
msgid "Atesto"
msgstr "Atesto"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:123
msgid ""
"Show small popups of recent real purchases to build trust and urgency. Only a"
" first name and city are ever shown, never full names, emails or addresses."
msgstr ""
"Zeige kleine Popups der letzten echten Käufe an, um Vertrauen und "
"Dringlichkeit aufzubauen. Es werden immer nur Vorname und Stadt angezeigt, "
"niemals vollständige Namen, E-Mails oder Adressen."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:133
msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "Änderungen speichern"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:149
msgid "General"
msgstr "Allgemein"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:154
msgid "Enable Atesto"
msgstr "Atesto aktivieren"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:155
msgid ""
"Master switch. When off, no popups are loaded or rendered anywhere on the "
"storefront."
msgstr ""
"Hauptschalter. Wenn diese Option deaktiviert ist, werden nirgendwo in der "
"Storefront Popups geladen oder gerendert."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:161
msgid "Screen corner"
msgstr "Bildschirmecke"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:163
msgid "Bottom left"
msgstr "Unten links"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:164
msgid "Bottom right"
msgstr "Unten rechts"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:165
msgid "Top left"
msgstr "Oben links"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:166
msgid "Top right"
msgstr "Oben rechts"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:169
msgid "Which corner of the screen the popup slides in from."
msgstr "Aus welcher Ecke des Bildschirms das Popup eingeblendet wird."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:182
msgid "What each popup shows"
msgstr "Was jedes Popup zeigt"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:183
msgid ""
"Each popup shows the buyer's first name, billing city, the product name and "
"how long ago the purchase happened. Surnames, emails and full addresses are "
"never shown."
msgstr ""
"In jedem Popup werden der Vorname des Käufers, der Ort der Rechnungsstellung,"
" der Produktname und die Zeit angezeigt, vor der der Kauf getätigt wurde. "
"Nachnamen, E-Mail-Adressen und vollständige Adressen werden niemals "
"angezeigt."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:191
msgid "Fallback name"
msgstr "Fallback-Name"

#. translators: %s is the translated default word shown when an order has no
#. first name.
#: src/Admin/Settings.php:195
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Shown in place of a first name when the order has none. Leave blank to use "
"the default, “%s”."
msgstr ""
"Wird anstelle eines Vornamens angezeigt, wenn die Bestellung keinen enthält. "
"Leer lassen, um den Standardwert „%s“ zu verwenden."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:196 src/Service/OrderFeed.php:130
msgid "Someone"
msgstr "Jemand"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:210
msgid "Timing"
msgstr "Timing"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:213
msgid "Initial delay (seconds)"
msgstr "Anfängliche Verzögerung (Sekunden)"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:213
msgid ""
"How long to wait after the page loads before the first popup appears. Default"
" 5 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Wie lange nach dem Laden der Seite gewartet werden soll, bevor das erste "
"Popup erscheint. Standardmäßig 5 Sekunden."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:214
msgid "Display time (seconds)"
msgstr "Anzeigezeit (Sekunden)"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:214
msgid ""
"How long each popup stays on screen before sliding away. Default 6 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Wie lange jedes Popup auf dem Bildschirm bleibt, bevor es verschwindet. "
"Standardmäßig 6 Sekunden."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:215
msgid "Interval between popups (seconds)"
msgstr "Intervall zwischen Popups (Sekunden)"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:215
msgid ""
"Gap between one popup disappearing and the next appearing. Lower values show "
"more popups; higher values feel calmer. Default 12 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Lücke zwischen dem Verschwinden eines Popups und dem Erscheinen des nächsten."
" Niedrigere Werte zeigen mehr Popups an; Höhere Werte fühlen sich ruhiger an."
" Standardmäßig 12 Sekunden."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:228
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Beispiel"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:235
msgid "Alex from Berlin"
msgstr "Alex aus Berlin"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:235
msgid "bought Merino Hoodie"
msgstr "Merino Hoodie gekauft"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:236
msgid "2 hours ago"
msgstr "Vor 2 Stunden"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:253
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Aktiviert"

#: src/Service/FrontendService.php:87
msgid "Recent purchase"
msgstr "Kürzlich gekauft"

#: src/Service/FrontendService.php:88
msgid "Dismiss notification"
msgstr "Benachrichtigung verwerfen"

#. translators: connects a name to a city, e.g. "Alex from Berlin".
#: src/Service/FrontendService.php:90
msgid "from"
msgstr "von"

#. translators: connects a buyer to a product, e.g. "bought Hoodie".
#: src/Service/FrontendService.php:92
msgid "bought"
msgstr "gekauft"

#. translators: %s: human-readable time difference, e.g. "2 hours".
#: src/Service/OrderFeed.php:177
#, php-format
msgid "%s ago"
msgstr "Vor %s"

